# The project is formatted with oxfmt (.oxfmtrc.json, `npm run format`). This file only exists
# for editors that run Prettier on save.
#
# MDX: Prettier still parses it with MDX 1 rules, where a line starting with a tag is a block of
# JSX. It reflows such a line (e.g. a paragraph that starts with <Link …>) onto several lines,
# and MDX then renders it as a separate block instead of inline text.
**/*.mdx
dist/
.astro/
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
# Google Search Console verification file: Google compares it byte for byte, so no formatter
# may touch it.
public/google*.html
